{"seq":1,"slug":"signal-conditioning","title":"信号调理电路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/signal-conditioning","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"信号调理电路\">信号调理电路</h1><p>一只应变片在满负荷下电阻变化可能只有千分之几，桥路输出几个毫伏，淹没在工频干扰与放大器自身的噪声里；一只热电偶给出的是几十微伏的温差电动势。这些来自<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">物理量传感</a>的原始信号，几乎没有一个能直接喂给 <a href=\"adc-sampling\">ADC</a>——它们太弱、阻抗不匹配、混着共模干扰、还可能非线性。信号调理电路就是横在敏感元件与数字世界之间的那段模拟前端，负责把原始信号「放大、滤波、隔离、变换」成 ADC 满量程内干净的电压。这一篇讲清这段模拟前端的核心电路与设计取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>信号调理是一条有顺序的处理链，每一环解决一类问题。下图给出从传感器到 ADC 的典型链路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[传感器输出&lt;br/&gt;μV-mV 高阻 含共模] --&gt; B[激励/桥路&lt;br/&gt;无源传感器供电]&#10;  B --&gt; IA[仪表放大器&lt;br/&gt;差分放大 抑制共模]&#10;  IA --&gt; F[抗混叠滤波&lt;br/&gt;限带 去工频]&#10;  F --&gt; L[电平搬移/缓冲&lt;br/&gt;匹配 ADC 输入范围]&#10;  L --&gt; ISO{需要隔离?}&#10;  ISO --&gt;|是| OPT[隔离放大器&lt;br/&gt;断地环]&#10;  ISO --&gt;|否| ADC[送往 ADC]&#10;  OPT --&gt; ADC\">flowchart TD\n  S[传感器输出&lt;br/&gt;μV-mV 高阻 含共模] --&gt; B[激励/桥路&lt;br/&gt;无源传感器供电]\n  B --&gt; IA[仪表放大器&lt;br/&gt;差分放大 抑制共模]\n  IA --&gt; F[抗混叠滤波&lt;br/&gt;限带 去工频]\n  F --&gt; L[电平搬移/缓冲&lt;br/&gt;匹配 ADC 输入范围]\n  L --&gt; ISO{需要隔离?}\n  ISO --&gt;|是| OPT[隔离放大器&lt;br/&gt;断地环]\n  ISO --&gt;|否| ADC[送往 ADC]\n  OPT --&gt; ADC</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理环节</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>关键器件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>激励与桥路</td>\n<td>给调制型传感器供能、把参数变化变电压</td>\n<td>恒流/恒压源、惠斯通电桥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放大</td>\n<td>信号太弱</td>\n<td>仪表放大器、运放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共模抑制</td>\n<td>长线引入工频/地噪</td>\n<td>差分结构、高 CMRR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滤波</td>\n<td>限带、抗混叠</td>\n<td>RC/有源滤波器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电平/阻抗变换</td>\n<td>匹配 ADC 范围与驱动能力</td>\n<td>缓冲、电平搬移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"惠斯通电桥-把微小阻变换成电压\">惠斯通电桥：把微小阻变换成电压</h2><p>对应变片、压阻式压力传感器这类输出为微小电阻变化的器件，惠斯通电桥是标准接法。它把电阻变化转成差分电压：当四臂电阻平衡时输出为零，某臂变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 时，半桥输出近似</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>ex</mtext></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_\\text{out} = \\frac{V_\\text{ex}}{4}\\cdot\\frac{\\Delta R}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ex</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>电桥的妙处在于<strong>温度自补偿</strong>与<strong>共模抑制</strong>：把两个或四个应变片对称布置（全桥），相同温漂在差分中抵消，同时灵敏度翻倍。代价是输出仍是 mV 级且骑在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>ex</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_\\text{ex}/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ex</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 的大共模电平上，必须由能抑制共模、且不被高源阻抗拖累的放大器接手——这就引出仪表放大器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放大-仪表放大器为何是默认选择\">放大：仪表放大器为何是默认选择</h2><p>普通运放做差分放大有两个硬伤：输入阻抗有限会给高阻传感器分压、增益由外部电阻匹配度决定共模抑制比（CMRR）。<strong>仪表放大器（in-amp）</strong> 用三运放结构把这两个问题一并解决——两级缓冲提供极高输入阻抗，增益仅由一只外置电阻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 设定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = 1 + \\frac{2R_1}{R_G}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 CMRR 由内部激光修调的电阻网络保证，可达 100 dB 以上，把长导线引入的工频共模干扰压到信号之下。这是桥式与热电偶前端的默认放大器。</p>\n<p>噪声是放大级的核心约束。放大器自身有输入电压噪声与电流噪声，前者乘以增益、后者乘以源阻抗后叠加到信号上。对热电偶这类极弱信号，要选<strong>斩波稳零（chopper）</strong> 放大器把低频 1/f 噪声与失调降到纳伏级；当前低噪声前端的趋势正是把斩波连续时间放大器与 <a href=\"adc-sampling\">Δ-Σ ADC</a> 集成在一颗模拟前端芯片里（<a href=\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10736855/\">来源</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滤波与抗混叠-在采样之前限带\">滤波与抗混叠：在采样之前限带</h2><p>放大后的信号必须先限带再交给 ADC，原因是采样会把高于奈奎斯特频率的成分「折叠」回基带，造成无法去除的混叠失真——这条采样定理的来龙去脉在 <a href=\"adc-sampling\">ADC 与采样</a>里详述，这里只看调理端要做的事：在 ADC 前放一个<strong>抗混叠低通滤波器</strong>，把带外（尤其工频 50/60 Hz 及其谐波、开关电源噪声）压下去。</p>\n<p>最简单的是 RC 一阶低通，截止频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_c = 1/(2\\pi RC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但滚降太缓；要求陡峭时用有源滤波器（Sallen-Key、多重反馈）实现二阶以上的巴特沃斯或贝塞尔响应。这里有个权衡：巴特沃斯通带最平坦但相位非线性，贝塞尔相位线性、群延迟平坦适合保波形。滤波器阶数、ADC 过采样率与抗混叠裕量需要联合设计——过采样越高，对模拟滤波器的陡峭度要求越低，这正是 Δ-Σ 架构能省掉陡峭模拟滤波器的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离-保护与基准\">隔离、保护与基准</h2><p>最后三件常被忽视却决定可靠性的事。<strong>隔离</strong>：当传感器与采集端处于不同地电位（电机驱动、电力监测、医疗设备），需用隔离放大器（光、电容或磁耦合）切断地环路，既保安全又消除共模干扰，这在<a href=\"../actuators/motors-drives\">电机与驱动</a>的电流采样里尤为关键。<strong>保护</strong>：传感器引线暴露在外，要加 TVS、RC 钳位与限流电阻防静电与浪涌。<strong>基准电压</strong>：放大与 ADC 共用一个低温漂基准源，基准的漂移会直接成为系统增益误差，常常是<a href=\"../sensing/sensor-classification\">误差预算</a>里被低估的一项。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计要点</th>\n<th>后果若忽视</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隔离断地环</td>\n<td>共模噪声、安全隐患、烧毁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入保护</td>\n<td>ESD/浪涌损坏前端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低温漂基准</td>\n<td>增益随温度漂移、精度劣化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声匹配源阻抗</td>\n<td>信噪比被放大器噪声吃掉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信号调理是敏感元件与 ADC 之间的模拟前端，按链路依次解决：激励、放大、共模抑制、滤波、电平/阻抗变换、隔离。</li>\n<li>惠斯通电桥把微小阻变换成差分电压并实现温度自补偿，是应变/压阻前端的标准接法。</li>\n<li>仪表放大器以高输入阻抗、单电阻设增益、高 CMRR 成为弱信号默认放大器；极弱信号用斩波稳零压低 1/f 噪声。</li>\n<li>采样前必须用抗混叠滤波器限带，滤波阶数与过采样率联合设计；过采样可放宽模拟滤波要求。</li>\n<li>隔离、保护与低温漂基准决定可靠性与最终精度；基准漂移与放大器噪声常是被低估的误差源。调理后的信号交给 <a href=\"adc-sampling\">ADC 与采样</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信号调理电路","id":"信号调理电路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"惠斯通电桥：把微小阻变换成电压","id":"惠斯通电桥-把微小阻变换成电压"},{"level":2,"text":"放大：仪表放大器为何是默认选择","id":"放大-仪表放大器为何是默认选择"},{"level":2,"text":"滤波与抗混叠：在采样之前限带","id":"滤波与抗混叠-在采样之前限带"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离、保护与基准","id":"隔离-保护与基准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"光电与成像传感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/photo-imaging-sensing"},"next":{"title":"ADC 与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/adc-sampling"}}